       - Before placing each band, optionally insert 1-2 horizontally adjacent blockers
         at that row at the natural band position (or the already-shifted position),
         forcing further rightward deflection. Use 0-3 total blocker cells across 0-2 rows.
       - Fill connector cells on previous row when a gap is created.
       - Stop when left >= 10.
    4. Record the full output with trail painted. Remove trail cells to get the input
